Here is a simple way to check if a string contains a substring in JavaScript:
```python
if string.indexOf(substring) !== -1 {
    // the string contains the substring
}
```
The <code>indexOf()</code> method returns the index of the first occurrence of the substring within the string. If the substring is not found, it returns -1. So, by checking if the return value is not equal to -1, we can determine if the string contains the substring.
