You can include a JavaScript file in another JavaScript file using the <code>import</code> statement. Here's an example:</p>

<p>For example, if you have a file called <code>myScript.js</code> that you want to include in another file called <code>index.js</code>, you can use the following code in <code>index.js</code>:</p>

<pre><code>import './myScript.js';
