<p>This will import the contents of <code>myScript.js</code> into <code>index.js</code>. Note that the file path is relative to the current file.</p>

<p>If you want to import the contents of multiple files, you can use the following code:</p>

<pre><code>import './myScript.js';
import './anotherScript.js';
</code></pre>

<p>This will import the contents of both <code>myScript.js</code> and <code>anotherScript.js</code> into <code>index.js</code>.</p><|file_sep|><|fim_prefix|>/README.md
